# Gate scratch and selftest evidence are OUTPUTS, not sources (METHOD rule 1).
# `nopekit gate selftest` writes its fixtures and reports under a run's
# out_dir, which lands here when the pack is exercised in place. A committed
# copy is a generated file masquerading as a source: it goes stale silently and
# the next reader cannot tell which run produced it.
.selftest-out/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
